README
------

* ArrayPrint.java
  demonstrates different ways to output an array

* RecordPrint.java
  demonstrates how to define, and access a record. Uses record named User
  as defined in User.java

* RecordArraylist.java
  demonstrates how to define, and access an Arraylist of records. Uses 
  record named User

* User.java
  demonstrates how to define a record (data structure)
  
